Çünkü 5 tane projemiz var

357
00:42:37,752 --> 00:42:39,931
Biz de bitirdiğimiz projeyi

358
00:42:39,931 --> 00:42:41,631
Doğru

359
00:42:41,631 --> 00:42:42,451
Evet

360
00:42:42,451 --> 00:42:43,931
Tamam şimdi

361
00:42:43,931 --> 00:42:47,252
